  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "2. Cut off the tops of the rocoto peppers and remove seeds.",
    "3. In a bowl, mix together cooked jolly good rice, cubed tofu, diced relleno, and peruvian seasoning blend.",
    "4. Stuff each rocoto pepper with the rice mixture.",
    "5. Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt.",
    "6. Place the stuffed rocoto peppers on the grill and cook for 10-12 minutes, turning occasionally.",
    "7. Serve hot and enjoy!"
